Take a look at JavaScript events in shiny: http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/js-events.html

Specifically, you want the "shiny:connected" event.

What's happening is that the code does run when the document is ready, but that only means that the HTML finished rendering and shiny isn't ready yet. The fix in your case: replace `$(document).ready(function() { ` with `$(document).on("shiny:connected", function() { `

